  ["break leaves the innermost for, switch or select. A label breaks an outer one."] = "break 跳出最内层的 for、switch 或 select。加标签可以跳出外层。",
  ["cap is the room in the backing array. append doubles it when len reaches cap."] = "cap 是底层数组的空间。len 到达 cap 时 append 会翻倍。",
  ["ch := make(___)        // unbuffered\n"] = "ch := make(___)        // 无缓冲\n",
